WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:03.480
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.480 --> 00:06.070
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.740 --> 00:10.140
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.840 --> 00:14.850
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.220 --> 00:17.750
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.090 --> 00:21.530
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.280 --> 00:28.500
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.180 --> 00:34.260
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.060 --> 00:37.550
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.550 --> 00:40.160
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.680 --> 00:47.940
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.910 --> 00:51.670
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.730 --> 00:54.570
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.860 --> 00:55.890
♪Let me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.160
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.610 --> 01:03.290
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.580 --> 01:06.280
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.450 --> 01:07.920
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.920 --> 01:12.090
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.450 --> 01:22.700
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.130 --> 01:29.680
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.880 --> 01:32.789
=Episode 25=

01:42.759 --> 01:44.800
(I will not let Li Kuang die.)

01:45.560 --> 01:47.200
(Nor will I let Rundu fall.)

02:18.360 --> 02:19.360
What are you doing here?

02:19.560 --> 02:21.200
I told you she was suspicious.

02:21.440 --> 02:22.320
You didn't believe me.

02:23.160 --> 02:24.400
Looks like you're leaving.

02:24.760 --> 02:25.600
Where are you going?

02:28.440 --> 02:29.280
To Rundu.

02:29.760 --> 02:30.840
It's not far from Huayuan,

02:31.200 --> 02:32.200
serving as a stronghold.

02:32.520 --> 02:33.360
The enemies

02:33.520 --> 02:34.560
failed to take Huayuan,

02:34.880 --> 02:35.800
so they might divert

02:36.320 --> 02:37.160
to attack Rundu.

02:38.000 --> 02:40.160
Even if what you said is true,

02:40.280 --> 02:41.120
what can you do

02:41.360 --> 02:42.200
alone?

02:43.160 --> 02:44.000
An old friend of mine

02:44.600 --> 02:45.560
is currently in Rundu.

02:46.320 --> 02:48.280
I can't stand by while he's in danger.

02:49.079 --> 02:49.920
If that's the case,

02:50.280 --> 02:51.120
let's go together.

02:51.840 --> 02:52.680
No.

02:52.840 --> 02:54.040
Leaving without permission

02:54.160 --> 02:55.400
will get you punished.

02:55.880 --> 02:56.720
Moreover,

02:58.000 --> 02:59.360
Rundu is extremely dangerous now.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.920
If it's that dangerous,

03:02.000 --> 03:03.720
we can't let a woman

03:03.720 --> 03:04.800
face this peril alone.

03:05.440 --> 03:06.280
Exactly!

03:06.520 --> 03:07.520
Let's go together.

03:12.840 --> 03:13.680
When

03:16.000 --> 03:17.040
did you know this?

03:19.000 --> 03:21.680
When you went to Jiyang with Commander.

03:25.800 --> 03:28.120
That woman looks familiar.

03:28.280 --> 03:29.960
Did we see her somewhere before?

03:30.400 --> 03:33.400
Don't you think she looks like He Yan?

03:33.480 --> 03:34.640
Well,

03:35.160 --> 03:36.640
is that person

03:36.800 --> 03:38.440
He's sister?

03:38.840 --> 03:39.720
Not his sister.

03:40.400 --> 03:41.440
That's He Yan herself.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.720
I knew it!

03:45.480 --> 03:47.240
He is fair-skinned.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.480
Turns out to be a woman.

03:49.680 --> 03:51.160
If He Yan is truly female,

03:51.240 --> 03:53.360
that's a big surprise.

03:53.880 --> 03:54.720
Wait,

03:54.920 --> 03:55.960
but He dressed

03:56.040 --> 03:57.000
in men's clothes

03:57.240 --> 03:58.280
all the time.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.960
But he's changed his clothes...

04:02.720 --> 04:04.080
He's a she!

04:04.480 --> 04:05.880
What should we call her now?

04:06.160 --> 04:07.080
He, naturally.

04:08.400 --> 04:09.240
Miss He?

04:09.360 --> 04:10.200
Anyway,

04:10.400 --> 04:11.520
let's keep her secret.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.760
You knew my identity all along,

04:16.160 --> 04:17.399
yet you kept it secret?

04:18.720 --> 04:19.560
Of course.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.120
Otherwise, you'll get expelled

04:21.399 --> 04:22.400
for breaking rules.

04:25.400 --> 04:26.920
Even knowing I hide stuff from you,

04:27.680 --> 04:28.880
you still treat me the same.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.000
I am

04:31.800 --> 04:32.800
truly grateful.

04:33.280 --> 04:35.080
Enough with the sentimental talk.

04:35.120 --> 04:37.000
You're giving me goosebumps.

04:37.080 --> 04:38.120
Alright.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.320
However,

04:39.320 --> 04:40.840
you can't go with me.

04:40.960 --> 04:41.800
Why not?

04:41.800 --> 04:42.680
If you can go,

04:42.680 --> 04:43.800
why can't we?

04:43.960 --> 04:45.640
Exactly! We're going together.

04:45.720 --> 04:46.960
She's now a military attendant,

04:47.280 --> 04:48.320
not a regional commander.

04:48.760 --> 04:49.680
Yet it's an emergency.

04:51.080 --> 04:51.920
I'll go with you all.

04:53.720 --> 04:54.640
You don't have to.

04:55.560 --> 04:57.020
As Director of the Ministry of War,

04:57.280 --> 04:58.840
overseeing military affairs is my job.

04:58.920 --> 04:59.840
How can I sit on this?

05:06.440 --> 05:07.280
Well...

05:08.840 --> 05:09.680
The more hands,

05:10.160 --> 05:11.000
the better.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.440
Isn't it good?

05:13.240 --> 05:14.160
You're going

05:14.320 --> 05:15.280
for official business,

05:15.760 --> 05:17.480
while I'm going for personal reasons.

05:19.760 --> 05:20.960
What makes you think so?

05:23.400 --> 05:24.480
Why are you alone?

05:24.720 --> 05:25.720
Where's Yingxiang?

05:26.200 --> 05:27.040
It happened abruptly.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.720
I sent her to handle something.

05:30.000 --> 05:30.880
Enough.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.200
Let's not dawdle any longer.

05:32.720 --> 05:33.560
Come on.

05:34.440 --> 05:35.280
Go.

06:07.690 --> 06:09.620
(Battlefield in Rundu)

06:10.000 --> 06:12.000
We'll arrive in Rundu soon.

06:13.120 --> 06:13.960
I'm afraid

06:14.200 --> 06:15.800
we can't enter through the city gates.

06:19.600 --> 06:20.640
You were right.

06:21.280 --> 06:22.600
Wutuo is attacking Rundu.

06:23.480 --> 06:24.400
It seems

06:24.920 --> 06:26.240
He Rufei hasn't come.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.480
(He Rufei.)

06:28.880 --> 06:30.240
(You knew I'd come, didn't you?)

06:30.800 --> 06:32.840
(Planning to use Wutuo to eliminate me?)

06:33.440 --> 06:34.280
(Guess what?)

06:34.400 --> 06:35.560
(I won't let you succeed.)

06:35.880 --> 06:37.120
Rundu is currently besieged.

06:37.560 --> 06:38.440
How should we proceed?

06:38.880 --> 06:39.720
Follow me.

06:39.840 --> 06:41.520
I know of a secret tunnel into the city.

06:47.690 --> 06:50.310
(Commander's Mansion)

06:55.080 --> 06:55.920
Commander.

06:56.380 --> 06:58.010
Reinforcements from Huayuan
haven't come.

06:58.400 --> 06:59.800
Our supplies are exhausted.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.440
If we break through,

07:02.040 --> 07:03.400
we might be able to turn the tide.

07:04.000 --> 07:04.840
Stay calm.

07:05.320 --> 07:07.040
Wutuo's soldiers aren't made of iron.

07:07.840 --> 07:08.880
They need provisions too.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.200
Moreover,

07:10.200 --> 07:11.600
they've deployed larger forces.

07:12.120 --> 07:13.400
They need more supply.

07:14.200 --> 07:15.640
Without a quick victory,

07:16.000 --> 07:16.920
their morale

07:17.080 --> 07:18.320
will dwindle faster than ours.

07:18.400 --> 07:19.240
But...

07:19.240 --> 07:20.280
Unrest is spreading.

07:20.480 --> 07:21.600
Some grow restless,

07:21.600 --> 07:22.440
afraid of chaos.

07:22.720 --> 07:23.920
Deploy patrols

07:24.120 --> 07:25.440
to maintain order day and night.

07:25.880 --> 07:26.720
As you command.

07:28.040 --> 07:28.880
Mr. Wang.

07:29.200 --> 07:30.040
Master.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.080
Why are you here?

07:33.320 --> 07:35.040
(Qi Luo, Li Kuang's concubine)
You haven't eaten all day.

07:35.280 --> 07:36.600
That's not good.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.600
If Wutuo attacks again,

07:38.720 --> 07:40.200
we need you to lead us.

07:41.960 --> 07:42.920
You stay out

07:42.920 --> 07:43.800
of military affairs.

07:44.800 --> 07:45.880
I apologize.

07:46.200 --> 07:47.040
Leave us now.

07:47.200 --> 07:48.159
I have official matters.

07:49.240 --> 07:50.080
Yes.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.320
Why hasn't General Feihong

07:54.760 --> 07:55.760
arrived yet?

07:56.360 --> 07:57.360
Huayuan isn't far

07:57.360 --> 07:58.200
from Rundu.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.120
Rundu is tightly encircled.

08:00.680 --> 08:01.960
Even General Feihong will

08:02.360 --> 08:03.400
struggle to break through.

08:03.800 --> 08:04.640
Commander!

08:05.280 --> 08:06.880
- Commander!
- What's it?

08:06.880 --> 08:08.040
Intruders have infiltrated.

08:08.600 --> 08:09.440
What?

08:09.440 --> 08:10.400
Could they be

08:10.440 --> 08:11.280
reinforcements?

08:17.600 --> 08:18.440
General!

08:23.520 --> 08:24.480
(Not him?)

08:25.520 --> 08:26.880
(But he looks like...)

08:28.280 --> 08:29.120
Well,

08:29.360 --> 08:30.200
who are you?

08:33.720 --> 08:35.520
I'm He Yan, a military attendant.

08:35.840 --> 08:36.760
Nice to meet you.

08:37.720 --> 08:38.679
He Yan?

08:39.039 --> 08:40.120
Rundu is being besieged

08:40.120 --> 08:41.000
by Wutuo.

08:41.600 --> 08:42.679
How did you enter?

08:43.799 --> 08:44.640
Commander Li.

08:46.280 --> 08:47.240
This isn't the place

08:47.240 --> 08:48.160
for discussions.

08:49.360 --> 08:51.320
I'm Chu Zhao,
Director of the Ministry of War.

08:56.640 --> 08:57.640
You two, come with me.

08:58.000 --> 08:59.120
The rest, wait outside.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.560
What's wrong with him?

09:12.000 --> 09:12.840
When General Feihong

09:12.840 --> 09:13.840
garrisoned Rundu,

09:14.040 --> 09:15.440
he ordered me to dig a tunnel

09:15.600 --> 09:16.440
leading out of town.

09:16.800 --> 09:17.640
Besides us two,

09:17.640 --> 09:18.720
only trusted aides knew it.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.320
No one else

09:20.360 --> 09:21.280
could know about it.

09:21.920 --> 09:23.360
How did you enter?

09:34.360 --> 09:35.880
If I'm correct,

09:36.400 --> 09:37.590
the letter for help was sent

09:37.720 --> 09:38.880
through that tunnel, right?

09:40.120 --> 09:42.200
How do you know
General Feihong's grappling skills?

09:49.200 --> 09:51.000
I served in the Fuyue Army

09:52.200 --> 09:53.520
as a garrison officer in Huayuan

09:53.880 --> 09:55.760
under General Wang Qi.

09:57.520 --> 09:58.800
He taught me grappling skills.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.360
He told me

10:00.800 --> 10:01.800
about the secret tunnel.

10:03.040 --> 10:03.880
But rest assured,

10:04.120 --> 10:05.480
I haven't disclosed it to anyone.

10:06.280 --> 10:07.600
What brings you here?

10:10.520 --> 10:11.560
I hear Rundu is besieged

10:11.960 --> 10:12.960
and you're in danger.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.120
So, I rushed here.

10:20.000 --> 10:20.840
Just for that?

10:21.480 --> 10:22.440
If the city falls,

10:23.000 --> 10:25.000
no one in this city will survive.

10:25.320 --> 10:27.080
As a soldier
sworn to protect the nation,

10:27.280 --> 10:28.480
how could I stand by?

10:30.520 --> 10:31.360
Moreover,

10:31.800 --> 10:32.800
this is also to repay

10:32.920 --> 10:34.240
General Wang Qi's trust in me.

10:34.800 --> 10:35.960
I wish to help.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.040
Master.

10:43.040 --> 10:43.880
You're injured.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.200
How are you doing?

10:45.480 --> 10:47.480
Let me get medicine for you.

10:48.160 --> 10:49.200
A woman like you

10:49.440 --> 10:50.600
always makes a big fuss.

10:50.840 --> 10:51.960
It's just a minor injury.

10:54.280 --> 10:55.440
I apologize.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.520
Madam, you're quite considerate.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.480
You did nothing wrong.

11:01.920 --> 11:02.760
Don't blame yourself.

11:07.360 --> 11:09.320
Mr. He's grappling technique

11:09.800 --> 11:11.320
is truly impressive.

11:13.400 --> 11:14.680
Commander,

11:15.080 --> 11:16.960
what do you think of

11:17.160 --> 11:18.000
Mr. He's skill?

11:18.720 --> 11:19.640
It's impressive.

11:20.800 --> 11:23.000
Surprisingly, you already
master Fuyue Army's footwork

11:23.200 --> 11:25.280
and techniques.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.760
I see Wang Qi has

11:26.800 --> 11:28.240
taught you everything he knew.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.200
By the way,

11:29.280 --> 11:30.120
how is Wang Qi

11:30.120 --> 11:30.960
doing lately?

11:49.240 --> 11:50.200
I'll toast you with tea

11:50.600 --> 11:51.560
to thank you

11:51.720 --> 11:53.000
for helping settle my buddies.

12:00.880 --> 12:02.920
Rundu has been besieged for days.

12:03.400 --> 12:05.160
The secret tunnel is cramped,

12:05.720 --> 12:07.200
and I fear the enemy will find it.

12:07.480 --> 12:08.520
I can't use it frequently.

12:08.880 --> 12:11.480
I am ill-informed right now.

12:11.760 --> 12:12.600
I hope

12:13.080 --> 12:14.680
you can update me.

12:15.360 --> 12:17.240
The news that Rundu is being besieged

12:17.880 --> 12:19.360
has been deliberately suppressed.

12:19.680 --> 12:20.880
Yezhou Garrison hasn't heard.

12:21.400 --> 12:22.840
Even nearby Huayuan

12:23.000 --> 12:24.200
shows no signs of action.

12:24.920 --> 12:25.760
Furthermore,

12:25.840 --> 12:26.840
there's something else.

12:27.600 --> 12:28.440
When we

12:28.560 --> 12:29.520
used the secret tunnel,

12:29.960 --> 12:32.000
Wutuo soldiers seemed to notice.

12:32.480 --> 12:33.560
To prevent them

12:33.680 --> 12:35.240
from using the tunnel to enter,

12:35.680 --> 12:37.080
we sealed the tunnel.

12:37.720 --> 12:38.960
It is now impassable.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.680
Sorry, we did that

12:41.720 --> 12:42.960
without your permission.

12:43.640 --> 12:44.480
Never mind.

12:46.080 --> 12:46.920
That tunnel

12:48.200 --> 12:49.680
has limited use, anyway.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.480
Rest assured, Commander Li,

12:51.840 --> 12:53.120
I'll find solutions

12:53.680 --> 12:55.120
to ensure our soldiers and citizens

12:55.280 --> 12:56.120
aren't left helpless.

12:58.000 --> 12:59.000
I've instructed Yingxiang

12:59.160 --> 13:00.480
to spread the information

13:00.840 --> 13:02.080
and written to Ministry of War.

13:02.520 --> 13:03.360
I suppose

13:03.640 --> 13:05.200
the capital must be informed.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.280
So,

13:07.400 --> 13:08.640
you had Yingxiang

13:08.720 --> 13:09.600
handle that matter.

13:11.920 --> 13:13.200
But distant help

13:14.120 --> 13:15.800
can't quench present fires.

13:16.240 --> 13:17.080
To be frank,

13:17.600 --> 13:18.840
we're running out of food.

13:19.440 --> 13:20.520
We won't last long.

13:21.520 --> 13:23.360
Before supplies run out,

13:24.320 --> 13:26.080
we can only hope General Feihong...

13:26.280 --> 13:27.120
Mr. Li.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.120
Have you considered

13:28.720 --> 13:30.400
an attack instead of a defense?

13:31.040 --> 13:32.280
Rather than await doom,

13:32.680 --> 13:34.000
why not take initiative?

13:34.960 --> 13:36.800
A desperate fight sounds good,

13:37.200 --> 13:38.040
but how can I gamble

13:38.040 --> 13:40.320
with tens of thousands of lives?

13:40.440 --> 13:41.280
Moreover,

13:41.280 --> 13:42.560
Rundu is just the first line.

13:42.640 --> 13:44.480
Chonghuai will fall after it.

13:44.480 --> 13:45.720
- Heading north...
- Commander.

13:45.720 --> 13:46.560
I...

13:47.800 --> 13:49.440
Stop waiting for He Rufei.

13:54.320 --> 13:55.600
Didn't you just ask me

13:56.720 --> 13:58.280
about Wang Qi?

14:00.080 --> 14:01.320
Let me tell you now.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.360
He's dead.

14:09.840 --> 14:12.000
He died in the recent Huayuan Battle.

14:12.960 --> 14:14.120
Not just Wang Qi,

14:14.840 --> 14:16.480
but your six other buddies

14:19.120 --> 14:20.000
are all dead.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.320
Don't you understand yet?

14:28.520 --> 14:29.800
He Rufei

14:31.360 --> 14:32.560
won't come.

14:36.040 --> 14:37.280
You stay defensive,

14:37.920 --> 14:40.040
essentially surrendering
without a fight.

14:40.560 --> 14:43.640
This is truly gambling
with the lives of the citizens.

14:47.920 --> 14:50.040
There's no time left for grief now.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.160
Commander Li,

14:52.520 --> 14:54.000
we can't just wait for death.

14:54.440 --> 14:55.880
We must take the initiative.

14:56.360 --> 14:57.200
Tell me.

14:57.280 --> 14:58.120
How has the enemy

14:58.120 --> 14:59.160
been attacking recently?

15:00.800 --> 15:01.960
In the last ten days,

15:02.440 --> 15:03.680
there were five nights

15:04.160 --> 15:05.920
when they attacked the city gates.

15:07.200 --> 15:09.200
Though they withdrew each time,

15:11.120 --> 15:12.200
it seemed like a test.

15:13.840 --> 15:14.920
In the last three days,

15:15.920 --> 15:17.320
they have gone silent.

15:18.280 --> 15:19.520
Based on my experience

15:20.000 --> 15:21.240
fighting them,

15:21.720 --> 15:22.680
their silence

15:24.040 --> 15:25.200
doesn't bode well.

15:26.640 --> 15:27.480
I guess they are

15:28.320 --> 15:29.600
planning a full-scale assault.

15:30.040 --> 15:32.200
They've thoroughly assessed our defense

15:32.360 --> 15:33.360
by now.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.240
Our forces in Rundu

15:35.560 --> 15:37.800
have been worn down
after days of fighting.

15:38.040 --> 15:39.240
Soldiers' morale and stamina

15:39.440 --> 15:40.400
are getting worse.

15:41.240 --> 15:42.800
If they launch an attack now,

15:43.160 --> 15:44.000
the city gates

15:44.280 --> 15:45.240
will surely fall.

15:48.640 --> 15:51.080
Sounds like you know them pretty well.

15:51.840 --> 15:52.680
Commander Li,

15:52.920 --> 15:53.960
you're missing the point.

15:59.080 --> 15:59.920
Look,

16:00.160 --> 16:01.000
it's not that

16:01.000 --> 16:02.160
we refuse to be proactive,

16:02.800 --> 16:04.520
but our forces are already limited.

16:04.680 --> 16:05.680
Right now, the enemies

16:05.960 --> 16:06.960
are watching the gate.

16:08.080 --> 16:08.960
I fear

16:09.160 --> 16:10.520
our men will be shot with arrows

16:10.520 --> 16:12.320
before going outside the city gate.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.160
Arrows?

16:14.320 --> 16:15.160
Initially,

16:15.160 --> 16:16.280
when Wutuo troops arrived,

16:16.640 --> 16:18.520
we could fight them on the city walls.

16:19.080 --> 16:19.920
But later,

16:20.200 --> 16:21.560
our arrows dwindled,

16:21.880 --> 16:23.680
while theirs remained plentiful.

16:24.560 --> 16:26.520
Earlier, some tried
to infiltrate their ranks

16:26.760 --> 16:28.080
to assassinate their commander.

16:28.640 --> 16:30.480
But the moment they exited the gate,

16:31.160 --> 16:33.240
they were pierced by countless arrows.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.400
Do the enemies

16:35.880 --> 16:36.720
have numerous arrows?

16:37.280 --> 16:38.120
Yes.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.600
I have a plan.

16:43.080 --> 16:44.000
If executed properly,

16:44.440 --> 16:45.850
it can achieve two goals at once.

17:14.359 --> 17:15.800
We've waited here long enough.

17:16.119 --> 17:17.400
He Rufei isn't coming.

17:17.750 --> 17:19.670
(Nagur, Wutuo's Commander)
The Chancellor was right.

17:20.560 --> 17:21.640
Thankfully, we don't

17:21.839 --> 17:23.000
fight against Xiao Jue.

17:23.680 --> 17:24.520
Report!

17:26.200 --> 17:27.040
Commander.

17:27.040 --> 17:28.540
Someone is descending the city walls.

17:30.520 --> 17:31.440
Let's go take a look.

17:40.840 --> 17:41.960
Have they gone mad?

17:43.000 --> 17:44.920
This is suicide!

17:45.360 --> 17:46.520
In our homeland,

17:46.640 --> 17:47.720
there are badgers,

17:47.960 --> 17:49.000
which are quite timid.

17:49.600 --> 17:50.800
I hear when hunted,

17:51.120 --> 17:52.080
they don't flee

17:52.520 --> 17:53.440
but panic

17:53.520 --> 17:54.680
and run toward the arrows.

17:55.080 --> 17:55.920
I think

17:56.200 --> 17:58.040
they are the same.

17:59.320 --> 18:00.440
Get archers ready.

18:01.400 --> 18:02.640
Good target practice.

18:02.960 --> 18:03.800
Yes!

18:04.480 --> 18:05.920
Archers, take positions!

18:21.880 --> 18:22.720
Shoot!

18:38.240 --> 18:39.120
We have no arrows.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.480
During daylight,

18:40.480 --> 18:42.130
our soldiers don't dare
come up the walls.

18:42.480 --> 18:43.320
Those stationed

18:43.320 --> 18:44.160
on the walls

18:44.360 --> 18:45.560
get hit by arrows every day.

18:45.760 --> 18:47.600
Yet we lack sufficient arrows
to fight back.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.640
Now, we finally have arrows.

18:50.240 --> 18:51.960
This tactic feels familiar.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.880
Maybe I've read it in some storybook.

18:54.400 --> 18:56.080
But it works well.

18:56.800 --> 18:59.160
Past lessons guide future actions.

18:59.640 --> 19:00.480
The enemies

19:00.480 --> 19:01.760
rely on their superior numbers.

19:02.080 --> 19:03.000
They're too arrogant

19:03.360 --> 19:04.720
to believe they could fail.

19:05.120 --> 19:06.000
These straw dummies

19:06.040 --> 19:07.960
won't draw their attention.

19:08.240 --> 19:10.000
They think we have nothing,

19:10.320 --> 19:11.160
no soldiers,

19:11.160 --> 19:12.000
no provisions,

19:12.080 --> 19:12.920
and no help.

19:13.200 --> 19:14.360
So, we'll turn nothing

19:14.480 --> 19:15.640
into something.

19:15.960 --> 19:17.040
Catch them unprepared!

19:18.120 --> 19:18.960
But

19:19.680 --> 19:20.840
what if we fail?

19:22.040 --> 19:23.120
Then we find another way.

19:23.360 --> 19:24.200
In this world,

19:24.440 --> 19:25.800
there's never just one way.

19:32.920 --> 19:33.800
Report!

19:36.240 --> 19:37.080
Commander.

19:37.080 --> 19:38.520
They descend from the walls again.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.840
Those reckless fools!

20:03.400 --> 20:04.240
Commander.

20:04.440 --> 20:05.400
What's wrong

20:05.720 --> 20:06.560
with them?

20:06.880 --> 20:07.880
Aren't they afraid?

20:08.400 --> 20:09.720
We've rotated archers repeatedly.

20:18.280 --> 20:19.320
When you fired arrows,

20:20.040 --> 20:21.320
did you hear any screams?

20:22.400 --> 20:23.240
Today,

20:23.320 --> 20:24.160
I didn't.

20:25.160 --> 20:26.000
Stop!

20:26.680 --> 20:27.680
Stop shooting right now!

20:33.600 --> 20:34.440
So many arrows.

20:34.480 --> 20:35.320
Pull them out!

20:35.320 --> 20:36.160
Come on.

20:48.920 --> 20:49.760
General.

20:50.280 --> 20:51.640
They are descending again.

20:55.280 --> 20:56.520
Do they think we are

20:56.760 --> 20:58.120
giving arrows to them again?

21:02.080 --> 21:02.920
Pass the order.

21:04.120 --> 21:04.960
Fire a few arrows.

21:05.320 --> 21:06.240
Even if we break ours,

21:07.000 --> 21:08.000
we won't let them

21:08.080 --> 21:09.640
get our arrows again!

21:10.400 --> 21:11.240
Understood.

21:27.800 --> 21:28.640
(Three Days Earlier)
Today,

21:28.640 --> 21:29.760
we didn't scream.

21:30.280 --> 21:31.360
Won't the enemies realize

21:31.360 --> 21:32.200
our true purpose?

21:32.400 --> 21:33.240
It's hard

21:33.520 --> 21:34.360
to fool them again.

21:35.080 --> 21:35.920
I made straw dummies

21:36.200 --> 21:37.400
not just to get arrows.

21:37.680 --> 21:38.640
After tonight,

21:38.800 --> 21:39.640
the enemies

21:39.800 --> 21:41.320
must sense something's wrong.

21:41.600 --> 21:42.440
That's for sure.

21:44.760 --> 21:45.600
Mr. Li,

21:45.760 --> 21:46.920
if you were the enemy

21:47.320 --> 21:49.520
and realized you'd been fooled
all night,

21:49.880 --> 21:51.200
then saw the same trick today

21:51.400 --> 21:52.600
and again tomorrow,

21:53.000 --> 21:53.840
what would you do?

21:54.040 --> 21:54.880
Never fall for it.

21:55.520 --> 21:57.960
Stop shooting at people
descending the walls?

21:58.120 --> 21:58.960
Exactly.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.040
Perfect.

22:00.360 --> 22:01.200
Next time,

22:01.200 --> 22:02.840
our troops can exit the city directly.

22:03.520 --> 22:04.880
The enemies will assume

22:05.160 --> 22:06.520
anyone descending the walls

22:07.160 --> 22:09.040
is just another straw dummy.

22:18.520 --> 22:19.360
Mother,

22:20.200 --> 22:21.160
I beg you

22:21.880 --> 22:23.200
to protect He Yan

22:24.320 --> 22:25.680
and let her return safely.

22:28.490 --> 22:30.650
(Wutuo's Barracks)

23:13.400 --> 23:14.240
Come.

23:16.440 --> 23:17.280
We should

23:17.280 --> 23:19.120
split up and locate the granaries first.

23:19.280 --> 23:20.120
Listen,

23:20.120 --> 23:21.040
stay cautious.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.040
Got it?

23:22.720 --> 23:25.240
Are the oil packets ready?

23:25.320 --> 23:26.280
The oil.

23:27.280 --> 23:28.400
Right here!

23:29.200 --> 23:30.040
Move!

23:30.040 --> 23:31.840
- Let's go!
- Move!

23:31.840 --> 23:32.800
- Go!
- Go!

23:47.040 --> 23:47.880
Help!

23:47.880 --> 23:48.720
Stop right there.

23:49.240 --> 23:50.080
Come here!

23:50.560 --> 23:51.400
Come on.

23:52.840 --> 23:53.680
Stop running.

23:53.680 --> 23:54.520
Be good.

23:57.040 --> 23:58.160
Help!

23:58.160 --> 23:59.000
Don't run!

23:59.640 --> 24:00.480
Go over.

24:00.840 --> 24:01.800
Get over here!

24:03.080 --> 24:03.920
Let go of me!

24:04.720 --> 24:05.560
Let go of me!

24:06.480 --> 24:07.320
Come on.

24:07.640 --> 24:08.480
Let go of me!

24:08.480 --> 24:09.320
He.

24:09.920 --> 24:10.840
I know you pity them.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.280
But now, burning granaries

24:12.280 --> 24:13.120
is our mission.

24:13.360 --> 24:14.320
If we save them now,

24:14.640 --> 24:15.680
Mai and Wang Ba

24:15.760 --> 24:16.600
will get trapped.

24:16.920 --> 24:18.080
Our entire plan will fail.

24:18.280 --> 24:19.120
More people will

24:19.120 --> 24:19.960
end up suffering.

24:20.960 --> 24:21.800
Come on.

24:22.200 --> 24:23.040
Come here.

24:24.960 --> 24:25.800
We'll save them

24:26.280 --> 24:27.120
and burn granaries.

24:27.400 --> 24:28.400
Set the fires first,

24:28.680 --> 24:29.520
then rescue them.

24:35.520 --> 24:36.480
Fire!

24:36.840 --> 24:37.800
Fire!

24:38.160 --> 24:39.160
Put it out!

24:39.800 --> 24:41.000
Fire!

24:42.520 --> 24:43.360
Hurry!

24:44.080 --> 24:45.040
Don't be afraid.

24:45.800 --> 24:46.640
Thank you.

24:46.680 --> 24:47.520
Thank you, sir.

24:47.680 --> 24:48.960
Please save us, sir.

24:49.320 --> 24:50.840
- Please save us.
- Please save us.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.240
Huang.

24:54.240 --> 24:55.440
The fire's already raging.

24:55.720 --> 24:56.760
Take them away.

24:57.720 --> 24:59.360
Remember, don't attempt to fight.

24:59.360 --> 25:00.200
Make sure

25:00.400 --> 25:01.240
that all of us

25:01.280 --> 25:02.160
return safely.

25:02.520 --> 25:03.360
- Yes.
- Yes.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.680
It's General Feihong!

25:54.240 --> 25:55.080
Well...

25:55.080 --> 25:55.920
Is it really him?

25:57.480 --> 25:58.880
He Rufei can't be in Rundu.

25:59.920 --> 26:00.880
This man is an imposter!

26:02.400 --> 26:04.240
(He Rufei is indeed involved.)

26:04.600 --> 26:05.440
Everyone, attack!

26:05.720 --> 26:06.560
Kill them all!

26:43.360 --> 26:44.200
Qinglang Sword?

26:45.320 --> 26:46.240
The same skills.

26:47.720 --> 26:49.320
Could he be General Feihong?

26:50.000 --> 26:50.840
Move out!

26:54.800 --> 26:55.640
After them!

26:55.640 --> 26:56.480
Chase them down!

26:56.520 --> 26:57.360
Kill!

26:57.360 --> 26:58.200
Today,

26:58.240 --> 26:59.080
I swear

26:59.080 --> 27:01.520
I'll kill He Rufei, a faithless man.

27:08.280 --> 27:09.680
(I demanded a squad from Li Kuang.)

27:10.240 --> 27:11.080
I told him

27:11.480 --> 27:13.000
that my team would

27:13.640 --> 27:15.400
definitely burn the enemies' granaries.

27:15.680 --> 27:17.160
When you see flames rise,

27:17.680 --> 27:18.600
it means I succeed.

27:20.280 --> 27:21.120
Okay.

27:21.960 --> 27:23.400
I'll wait for the flames

27:24.240 --> 27:25.120
(and for your return.)

27:30.600 --> 27:31.440
They did it.

27:32.720 --> 27:33.640
They succeeded!

27:40.560 --> 27:43.380
♪Yet I yearn to stand opposed to you♪

27:43.690 --> 27:47.290
♪Seeking fleeting clarity♪

27:47.480 --> 27:48.320
(Zilan.)

27:49.200 --> 27:50.040
There, there.

27:50.040 --> 27:51.040
Mother.

27:51.520 --> 27:52.560
(Don't cry, Zilan.)

27:53.080 --> 27:54.320
I'm just tired.

27:55.560 --> 27:57.160
My poor son.

27:58.240 --> 27:59.920
When you study at night,

28:00.200 --> 28:01.640
with Mother gone,

28:02.520 --> 28:04.120
(how will you manage)

28:04.440 --> 28:05.480
(since you fear fire?)

28:12.240 --> 28:13.520
(I also want vengeance.)

28:14.520 --> 28:15.720
(But I'm like a caged bird,)

28:16.520 --> 28:17.360
(trapping myself)

28:17.360 --> 28:18.400
(in schemes.)

28:19.720 --> 28:21.000
(Yet you fear nothing,)

28:21.400 --> 28:22.360
(shattering the cage)

28:22.680 --> 28:23.600
(and charging forward.)

28:23.600 --> 28:24.680
♪Why♪

28:25.240 --> 28:26.200
(My name means light,)

28:26.920 --> 28:27.800
(yet I fear fire.)

28:28.760 --> 28:30.800
(I've been walking alone
through endless nights.)

28:32.440 --> 28:33.840
(You shine like wildfire,)

28:34.360 --> 28:35.320
(repelling the darkness)

28:36.800 --> 28:38.720
(and bringing me the light
I've never seen.)

28:40.480 --> 28:41.760
(You always gaze at the moon.)

28:42.920 --> 28:44.360
(Yet you don't know)

28:46.440 --> 28:48.320
(how radiant you are in my eyes.)

28:48.320 --> 28:53.630
♪My heart feels adrift♪

28:57.210 --> 29:00.480
(Xiao)

29:00.480 --> 29:01.320
Commander.

29:02.160 --> 29:03.120
On my way back, I hear

29:03.360 --> 29:04.200
Rundu is besieged.

29:04.200 --> 29:05.040
I'm already aware.

29:05.560 --> 29:06.400
No time to lose.

29:06.760 --> 29:07.600
You tell Shen Han

29:07.720 --> 29:08.680
to gather Nine Banners

29:08.960 --> 29:09.880
at the training field.

29:10.200 --> 29:11.360
Get ready to reinforce Rundu.

29:12.400 --> 29:13.240
Yes.

29:13.240 --> 29:14.080
And tell He Yan

29:14.480 --> 29:15.320
to go with me.

29:17.040 --> 29:17.880
Commander.

29:17.880 --> 29:18.960
He Yan is away.

29:19.400 --> 29:21.080
She left with Mai and the others.

29:22.320 --> 29:23.560
As expected, she went to Rundu.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.400
Chu Zhao went with them too.

29:32.960 --> 29:33.800
So,

29:34.360 --> 29:35.920
given the information you got

29:36.560 --> 29:38.800
and her current act of aiding Rundu,

29:39.680 --> 29:40.960
what do you think of her now?

29:46.440 --> 29:47.320
Go inform Shen Han.

29:47.840 --> 29:48.680
We depart right now.

29:49.840 --> 29:50.680
Yes.

30:17.120 --> 30:18.320
She took Qinglang.

30:46.920 --> 30:47.800
(Rundu is in peril.)

30:47.960 --> 30:48.800
(I'm going to help.)

30:49.160 --> 30:50.000
(I need your sword.)

31:35.880 --> 31:36.720
Are you injured?

31:36.800 --> 31:37.640
I'm fine.

31:40.120 --> 31:40.960
General He.

31:47.400 --> 31:48.240
Commander Li.

31:48.480 --> 31:49.320
Why did you

31:49.320 --> 31:50.360
address He like that?

31:50.400 --> 31:52.240
He isn't a general yet.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.480
This craftsman

32:00.520 --> 32:01.440
has exceptional skills.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.040
The mask he made

32:03.240 --> 32:04.320
looks utterly realistic.

32:05.640 --> 32:06.600
Last night, the enemies

32:06.840 --> 32:08.680
were fooled by this disguise too.

32:08.680 --> 32:10.360
They mistook me for General Feihong.

32:11.600 --> 32:13.200
This is truly masterful work.

32:14.720 --> 32:16.040
I also made a mistake.

32:16.800 --> 32:17.840
It's all ready.

32:20.080 --> 32:20.920
Well...

32:22.680 --> 32:23.960
General Feihong?

32:26.000 --> 32:26.840
Mr. Li.

32:27.280 --> 32:28.840
He is just a military attendant,

32:29.200 --> 32:30.320
not yet promoted to general.

32:32.480 --> 32:33.320
I meant,

32:33.760 --> 32:34.640
this mask

32:35.080 --> 32:36.480
belonged to General Feihong.

32:38.080 --> 32:39.160
What exactly will you do?

32:40.440 --> 32:41.720
Make a mixture of illusions

32:42.520 --> 32:43.400
and truths.

32:44.360 --> 32:45.600
Even Nagur hasn't seen

32:45.640 --> 32:46.880
the real General Feihong.

32:47.480 --> 32:48.600
But he must have heard

32:49.160 --> 32:51.800
about the masked general's
fierce battle against Liehe.

32:54.400 --> 32:57.000
I'll infiltrate the enemy camp
wearing this mask.

32:58.080 --> 32:58.920
They won't know

32:58.920 --> 33:00.960
who's truly beneath the mask.

33:01.640 --> 33:02.600
Their fear will

33:03.000 --> 33:03.920
destroy their morale.

33:04.720 --> 33:05.560
Then,

33:06.120 --> 33:07.800
we'll seize the opportunity.

33:13.040 --> 33:13.880
Commander Li.

33:14.400 --> 33:15.760
With their provisions burned

33:16.080 --> 33:18.320
and their fear
of General Feihong's presence in Rundu,

33:18.320 --> 33:19.160
I think

33:19.160 --> 33:20.360
they'll observe the situation.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.160
An immediate attack seems unlikely.

33:22.560 --> 33:24.040
This is our opportunity.

33:24.400 --> 33:25.240
Deploy

33:25.440 --> 33:26.680
a preemptive strike

33:27.080 --> 33:28.240
to resolve this swiftly

33:28.400 --> 33:29.960
and solve the food crisis.

33:32.280 --> 33:33.120
Commander Li.

33:33.520 --> 33:34.880
Our provisions are insufficient.

33:35.040 --> 33:36.000
We can't afford delays.

33:36.280 --> 33:37.680
If reinforcements don't come,

33:37.960 --> 33:38.960
people will die.

33:39.360 --> 33:40.720
You're versed in military tactics.

33:40.720 --> 33:41.560
You must know

33:41.720 --> 33:42.560
that defending a city

33:42.600 --> 33:44.000
is doomed if people starve.

33:45.040 --> 33:45.880
Public unrest

33:46.200 --> 33:47.040
breeds chaos.

33:49.560 --> 33:50.400
Commander Li.

33:51.040 --> 33:52.160
With the enemy at our gate,

33:52.520 --> 33:54.000
opportunities vanish quickly.

33:59.080 --> 33:59.920
Alright.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.560
I'll adjust the city's defenses,

34:01.880 --> 34:02.920
take inventory of weapons,

34:03.320 --> 34:04.640
and figure out a solution.

34:06.000 --> 34:06.840
By the way,

34:07.160 --> 34:08.000
one more thing.

34:08.760 --> 34:09.960
Regarding the women I rescued,

34:10.239 --> 34:11.080
I need

34:11.080 --> 34:12.679
to trouble you to check

34:13.040 --> 34:14.520
if they have relatives in the city.

34:14.920 --> 34:15.760
If they do,

34:16.040 --> 34:17.800
have their relatives take them home.

34:18.360 --> 34:19.199
If not,

34:19.639 --> 34:20.600
please

34:20.880 --> 34:22.159
properly settle them for me.

34:25.560 --> 34:26.400
Commander Li.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.080
I don't care what you think.

34:28.320 --> 34:29.199
These women

34:29.560 --> 34:30.800
are all citizens of Wei.

34:31.000 --> 34:32.239
They're people of Rundu.

34:33.520 --> 34:34.719
As the city's commander,

34:35.080 --> 34:36.320
you can't ignore them.

34:37.120 --> 34:38.159
A soldier's duty

34:38.480 --> 34:39.679
is to protect the people,

34:40.280 --> 34:41.719
rich or poor,

34:42.000 --> 34:42.840
without considering

34:42.920 --> 34:43.920
what they've experienced.

34:45.199 --> 34:46.040
Fine.

34:46.239 --> 34:47.080
I understand.

34:54.560 --> 34:55.560
You have enough medicine?

34:56.040 --> 34:56.880
Sure.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.040
Let me help.

34:58.040 --> 34:58.880
I'll help you.

35:00.920 --> 35:02.120
How's your leg injury?

35:02.160 --> 35:03.240
If you need more ointment,

35:03.280 --> 35:04.320
I'll have them fetch it.

35:04.680 --> 35:05.520
Thank you.

35:05.520 --> 35:06.360
It hurts.

35:06.640 --> 35:07.560
Don't worry, everyone,

35:07.920 --> 35:09.120
Master and Mr. He

35:09.240 --> 35:10.120
are good people.

35:10.920 --> 35:11.760
From now on,

35:11.920 --> 35:13.440
they won't let you suffer anymore.

35:18.200 --> 35:19.040
Master.

35:19.560 --> 35:20.520
Did you make the congee?

35:21.080 --> 35:21.920
Yes.

35:22.320 --> 35:24.160
They haven't eaten for days.

35:24.680 --> 35:26.320
They have lost their virginity.

35:26.720 --> 35:28.160
Letting them live is merciful.

35:28.400 --> 35:29.640
They're Rundu's shame!

35:29.720 --> 35:31.480
They don't deserve to eat the food.

35:32.400 --> 35:33.240
But

35:33.560 --> 35:35.440
they had no choice!

35:36.720 --> 35:37.840
Master, please calm down.

35:38.160 --> 35:39.000
Move away!

35:40.960 --> 35:41.800
Madam.

35:43.200 --> 35:44.640
Stop feeding them!

35:44.840 --> 35:46.120
Stop it, you hear me!

35:50.200 --> 35:52.160
Throwing your weight around?

35:53.280 --> 35:54.760
Qi Luo is my concubine.

35:55.120 --> 35:55.960
She is shortsighted.

35:56.520 --> 35:57.600
I have the right

35:58.080 --> 35:58.920
to handle my woman.

36:00.440 --> 36:02.120
True, she's your concubine,

36:02.480 --> 36:03.840
but she's not a cargo

36:04.280 --> 36:05.120
or some object

36:05.120 --> 36:06.640
to discard at will.

36:07.480 --> 36:08.880
She's a human being.

36:15.280 --> 36:16.120
And these women

36:16.840 --> 36:18.240
are all Rundu's citizens.

36:18.840 --> 36:20.040
Food belongs to all.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.760
Why can't they eat?

36:22.600 --> 36:23.440
Li Kuang.

36:23.440 --> 36:24.320
If you

36:24.320 --> 36:25.960
yell at the enemies

36:26.200 --> 36:27.080
or kill a few enemies,

36:27.440 --> 36:28.560
I'll respect your courage.

36:29.120 --> 36:30.400
But you're now

36:30.720 --> 36:32.880
yelling at helpless women.

36:33.680 --> 36:34.720
That's cowardice!

36:35.320 --> 36:36.160
You...

36:47.400 --> 36:48.240
Careful.

36:49.640 --> 36:50.480
Qi Luo.

